"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"REALIA:2.17\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">2.17</span> 标题：旗、旌旗（standard, ensign, banner）</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：אוֹת</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：’oth)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002002\" data-end-ref=\"04002002\">NUM 2:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19074004\" data-end-ref=\"19074004\">PSA 74:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19074004\" data-end-ref=\"19074004\">PSA 74:4</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：דגל</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：dagal（动词）)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19020006\" data-end-ref=\"19020006\">PSA 20:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"22006004\" data-end-ref=\"22006004\">SNG 6:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"22006010\" data-end-ref=\"22006010\">SNG 6:10</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：דֶּגֶל</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：degel)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04001052\" data-end-ref=\"04001052\">NUM 1:52</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002002\" data-end-ref=\"04002002\">NUM 2:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002003\" data-end-ref=\"04002003\">NUM 2:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002010\" data-end-ref=\"04002010\">NUM 2:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002017\" data-end-ref=\"04002017\">NUM 2:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002018\" data-end-ref=\"04002018\">NUM 2:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002025\" data-end-ref=\"04002025\">NUM 2:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002031\" data-end-ref=\"04002031\">NUM 2:31</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04002034\" data-end-ref=\"04002034\">NUM 2:34</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04010014\" data-end-ref=\"04010014\">NUM 10:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04010018\" data-end-ref=\"04010018\">NUM 10:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04010022\" data-end-ref=\"04010022\">NUM 10:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04010025\" data-end-ref=\"04010025\">NUM 10:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"22002004\" data-end-ref=\"22002004\">SNG 2:4</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：נֵס</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：nes)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02017015\" data-end-ref=\"02017015\">EXO 17:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04021008\" data-end-ref=\"04021008\">NUM 21:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04021009\" data-end-ref=\"04021009\">NUM 21:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19060006\" data-end-ref=\"19060006\">PSA 60:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23005026\" data-end-ref=\"23005026\">ISA 5:26</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23011010\" data-end-ref=\"23011010\">ISA 11:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23011012\" data-end-ref=\"23011012\">ISA 11:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23013002\" data-end-ref=\"23013002\">ISA 13:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23018003\" data-end-ref=\"23018003\">ISA 18:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23030017\" data-end-ref=\"23030017\">ISA 30:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23031009\" data-end-ref=\"23031009\">ISA 31:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23049022\" data-end-ref=\"23049022\">ISA 49:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23062010\" data-end-ref=\"23062010\">ISA 62:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24004006\" data-end-ref=\"24004006\">JER 4:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24004021\" data-end-ref=\"24004021\">JER 4:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24050002\" data-end-ref=\"24050002\">JER 50:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24051012\" data-end-ref=\"24051012\">JER 51:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24051027\" data-end-ref=\"24051027\">JER 51:27</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26027007\" data-end-ref=\"26027007\">EZK 27:7</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：נסס</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：nasas（动词）)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"38009016\" data-end-ref=\"38009016\">ZEC 9:16</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：תֹּרֶן</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：toren)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23030017\" data-end-ref=\"23030017\">ISA 30:17</data></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述和用途</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>\n            <figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0394_standards.png\" alt=\"不同式样的参旗\"><figcaption class=\"thlex-caption\">不同式样的参旗 (Cyclopedia of Biblical, Theological and Ecclesiastical Literature, Harper 1888, Public domain)</figcaption></figure>旌旗是一个特别显眼的标志，用来识别一个特定的群体。它可以是固定在一根长杆上面的旗帜或板。在很多情况下，这是一个固定在杆子末端的金属物件或图像（例如鹰或狮子的头），固定方式很像在枪杆上固定枪头。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻译</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>\n            <figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0395_standards_hans.jpg\" alt=\"参旗\"><figcaption class=\"thlex-caption\">参旗 (© Original file by Steerpike (File:Arch of Titus Menorah.png), CC BY 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons)</figcaption></figure>上列的希伯来文词语同时出现在军事和宗教语境中。在作战时，旌旗会被军队带上战场，并作为士兵的集合点。如果战斗获胜或者夺取了一个重要的据点，胜利方就会在那里竖立旌旗，表示获得了胜利。如果某种语言并不熟悉旗帜或旌旗，翻译者可以用以下方式表达<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19074004\" data-end-ref=\"19074004\">PSA 74:4</data> ：“他们已经把获胜的标记放在这里”，或“他们已经竖起标记，表示他们击败了我们”。</p>\n<p>\n            <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02017016\" data-end-ref=\"02017016\">EXO 17:16</data> 有一个文本上的问题。希伯来文本作<em>kes</em> ，意思是“座位”或“宝座”，有些译本接受一个校订的文本<em>nes</em> ，这个词语在上一节也出现过；例如，这节经文的前半节可译作：“他说：‘高举主的旌旗！’”（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Translation (1992)\">GNT</abbr> 直译）。有些译本保留<em>kes</em> ，不采用校订文本；例如，“他说：‘因手已举起达到主的宝座’”（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New International Version (1984)\">NIV</abbr> 直译）。</p>\n<p>\n            <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"38009016\" data-end-ref=\"38009016\">ZEC 9:16</data> ：希伯来文动词<em>mithnossoth</em> 的准确意思存疑。如果这个词和<em>nes</em> 有关，那么直译是“像旌旗那样被举起”。不过，只有几个译本（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"King James Version (1611)\">KJV</abbr> 、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New American Bible (1970)\">NAB</abbr> 、《武加大译本》）表达了这种含义。大部分翻译者和解经家都认为这个词和另一个希伯来文词根相关联，该词根的意思是“照耀”或“闪耀”。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
